          "kicker": "Column verdict",
          "heading": "Matt Dawson says England must embrace favourites tag before All Blacks clash",
          "body": "Writing after England's 78-15 demolition of Japan, BBC Sport columnist and England World Cup winner Matt Dawson wants England head coach Steve Borthwick's side bombarded with the favourites tag before Saturday's clash with New Zealand. He believes they are favourites, pointing to Wales' 35-28 win over the All Blacks as the reason he has faith in this group. Having beaten New Zealand last year, Dawson says England should not approach this home fixture with an underdog mentality."
        },
