      "edition": "Tuesday 17 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection return",
          "heading": "Grégory Alldritt returns at No. 8 against South Africa, with doubts unresolved",
          "body": "Grégory Alldritt started at No. 8 in Friday's 21-19 win over South Africa at the Stade de France, his first Bleus appearance in a year. He made 12 carries for 31 metres, beat a defender, had a clean sheet on his aerial catches and was involved in 22 ruck situations. Doubts about sustaining his intensity remain, but in his duel with Springbok Jasper Wiese the Stade Rochelais captain posted the better output over near-identical minutes, 49 to 45."
        },
