      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Quesada's Italy to name Fiji side by press release on Thursday",
          "body": "Italy's Fiji build-up is laid out in the federation's media programme. Head coach Gonzalo Quesada's squad will be announced by press release on Thursday, with a Zoom press conference the same day, and the captain's run is set for Friday at Udine's Bluenergy Stadium, the first 15 minutes open to media. The Fiji match is the third of Italy's November window, after the 7-66 loss to South Africa and the 14-19 defeat by Argentina in Genoa. The federation says timings may shift with the squad's commitments."
        },
