    "390": {
      "date": "2026-11-17",
      "edition": "Tuesday 17 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Defence praise",
          "heading": "Gregor Townsend hails Scotland's defence after 15-12 'arm wrestle' win over Australia",
          "body": "Scotland head coach Gregor Townsend said his side's defence was \"one of the best performances I've seen in the last couple of years\", in a Nations Championship \"arm wrestle\" that never produced the bonus point. The win followed a defeat by New Zealand in which Scotland failed to score a second-half point. Max Jorgensen's late converted try had given the Wallabies hope before Darcy Graham's superb tackle hauled full-back Tom Wright into touch as the clock ran red."
        },
        {
